{"seq":1,"slug":"server-scaling-patterns","title":"服务器扩缩容模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/infrastructure/server-scaling-patterns","wordCount":1664,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"服务器扩缩容模式\">服务器扩缩容模式</h1><p>当一款游戏从内测的几千人进入公测的百万人并发，单台服务器的物理极限很快触顶。扩缩容不是&quot;加机器&quot;这么简单——它涉及实例生命周期管理、区域部署策略、成本优化和故障隔离的系统性设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>服务器扩缩容的核心是<strong>Fleet Management</strong>——一个编排层，将游戏实例视为可调度的计算单元，根据实时需求动态启停。水平扩展（增加实例数）是匹配制游戏的天然模式，垂直扩展（升级单机）仅用于单实例玩家数极多的场景。区域部署压缩物理距离延迟，容器化加速启动时间，混合计费（Reserved + Spot + On-Demand）优化成本曲线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扩展方向-垂直-vs-水平\">扩展方向：垂直 vs 水平</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>垂直扩展（Scale Up）</th>\n<th>水平扩展（Scale Out）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>方法</td>\n<td>升级单机 CPU/RAM/网络</td>\n<td>增加服务器实例数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上限</td>\n<td>受单机硬件天花板限制</td>\n<td>理论无上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂度</td>\n<td>低（无需改架构）</td>\n<td>高（需要编排、路由、状态分割）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障域</td>\n<td>单点故障影响所有玩家</td>\n<td>单实例故障只影响一局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本曲线</td>\n<td>超线性增长（高端硬件溢价）</td>\n<td>近线性增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>单局玩家数极多（MMO 单分片）</td>\n<td>多局并行（竞技匹配制）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>现代游戏服务器架构几乎都采用水平扩展为主、垂直扩展为辅的策略。原因明确：匹配制游戏天然适合将每一局隔离到独立实例，实例之间无共享状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fleet-management-架构\">Fleet Management 架构</h2><p>Fleet Manager 是水平扩展的核心编排器。它维护一个服务器实例池，根据需求动态启停实例。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    MM[匹配服务] --&gt;|&quot;请求分配服务器&quot;| FM[Fleet Manager]&#10;    FM --&gt;|&quot;检查可用实例&quot;| Pool[(实例池)]&#10;    Pool --&gt;|&quot;有空闲&quot;| Assign[分配现有实例]&#10;    Pool --&gt;|&quot;无空闲&quot;| Scale[触发扩容]&#10;    Scale --&gt; Provider[云平台 API]&#10;    Provider --&gt;|&quot;新实例就绪&quot;| Pool&#10;    Assign --&gt;|&quot;返回 IP:Port&quot;| MM&#10;    FM --&gt;|&quot;定期巡检&quot;| Idle{空闲实例 &gt; 阈值?}&#10;    Idle --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| Shrink[缩容: 关闭多余实例]&#10;    Idle --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| Keep[保持当前规模]\">flowchart TD\n    MM[匹配服务] --&gt;|\"请求分配服务器\"| FM[Fleet Manager]\n    FM --&gt;|\"检查可用实例\"| Pool[(实例池)]\n    Pool --&gt;|\"有空闲\"| Assign[分配现有实例]\n    Pool --&gt;|\"无空闲\"| Scale[触发扩容]\n    Scale --&gt; Provider[云平台 API]\n    Provider --&gt;|\"新实例就绪\"| Pool\n    Assign --&gt;|\"返回 IP:Port\"| MM\n    FM --&gt;|\"定期巡检\"| Idle{空闲实例 &gt; 阈值?}\n    Idle --&gt;|\"是\"| Shrink[缩容: 关闭多余实例]\n    Idle --&gt;|\"否\"| Keep[保持当前规模]</pre><p>Fleet Manager 的核心参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>min_ready</code></td>\n<td>5-20</td>\n<td>始终保持的空闲实例数（避免冷启动等待）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_instances</code></td>\n<td>200-10000</td>\n<td>成本安全阀，防止失控扩容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scale_up_threshold</code></td>\n<td>空闲 &lt; 3</td>\n<td>触发扩容的条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scale_down_delay</code></td>\n<td>5-10 min</td>\n<td>实例空闲多久后才关闭（避免抖动）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>warmup_time</code></td>\n<td>10-30s</td>\n<td>新实例从启动到可接受玩家的时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"弹性伸缩策略\">弹性伸缩策略</h2><p>弹性伸缩需要预测性而非纯反应性。三种策略的对比：</p>\n<p><strong>反应式扩容</strong>：监控当前负载，超过阈值时启动新实例。问题是扩容有延迟（30s-2min），在流量突增时会出现排队等待。</p>\n<p><strong>预测式扩容</strong>：基于历史数据预测未来 10-30 分钟的流量。例如 AWS GameLift 利用历史模式在高峰到来前预先启动实例。</p>\n<p><strong>混合策略</strong>（推荐）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>predicted</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>reactive</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>buffer</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{target}} = \\max(N_{\\text{predicted}}, N_{\\text{reactive}}) + N_{\\text{buffer}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">predicted</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reactive</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buffer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>buffer</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{buffer}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buffer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是固定缓冲池，保证即使预测失准也有冗余。</p>\n<h2 id=\"区域部署与延迟优化\">区域部署与延迟优化</h2><p>全球部署的核心目标是让每个玩家的物理延迟（单程光速延迟）控制在可接受范围内。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域配置</th>\n<th>覆盖玩家</th>\n<th>额外运维复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单区域</td>\n<td>本地区玩家低延迟，远端玩家高延迟</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三区域（美/欧/亚）</td>\n<td>覆盖 90% 主要市场</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边缘部署（10+ PoP）</td>\n<td>几乎所有玩家 &lt;30ms</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>光速在光纤中的传输速度约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> m/s，跨大西洋（约 6000km）的理论单程延迟：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>min</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6000</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{min}} = \\frac{6000 \\times 10^3}{2 \\times 10^8} = 30\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2604em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>加上路由跳数和处理延迟，实际 RTT 通常为理论值的 1.5-2 倍。因此跨大西洋玩家的 RTT 通常在 90-120ms。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容器化与编排\">容器化与编排</h2><p>现代游戏服务器普遍采用容器化部署：</p>\n<p><strong>Docker 容器的优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>环境一致性：开发/测试/生产使用相同镜像</li>\n<li>快速启动：容器启动时间 2-5s vs 虚拟机 30-120s</li>\n<li>资源隔离：CPU/内存限额防止单局影响其他实例</li>\n<li>版本管理：镜像标签实现精确的版本回滚</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Kubernetes 的适用性争议</strong>：</p>\n<p>K8s 为长时间运行的无状态服务设计，而游戏服务器是<strong>有状态、生命周期由游戏逻辑驱动</strong>的。直接用 K8s 的 Deployment/ReplicaSet 会导致：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>滚动更新可能终止正在进行的匹配</li>\n<li>Pod 调度不感知&quot;这个实例正在运行一局比赛&quot;</li>\n<li>HPA（水平自动扩缩）的指标与游戏负载不匹配</li>\n</ul>\n<p>解决方案是使用 K8s 但配合游戏感知的自定义 Controller（如 Agones——Google 开源的游戏服务器编排系统），它理解 GameServer 的生命周期状态（Allocated / Ready / Shutdown），在匹配结束前不会终止实例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本优化模式\">成本优化模式</h2><p>云平台上游戏服务器的三种计费策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>节省幅度</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>On-Demand</td>\n<td>基准价</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>基线负载 + 峰值保障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reserved/Savings Plan</td>\n<td>30-60%</td>\n<td>承诺期内需持续使用</td>\n<td>已确定的基线负载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spot/Preemptible</td>\n<td>60-90%</td>\n<td>可能被中断回收</td>\n<td>非关键匹配、测试环境</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Spot 实例在游戏中的应用</strong>：AWS GameLift 的 FleetIQ 在多个 Spot 池之间分散风险。如果某个 Spot 池的回收率上升，自动将新匹配调度到其他池。对于已在进行的匹配，收到中断通知后有 2 分钟窗口执行优雅关闭（保存比赛结果、通知玩家）。</p>\n<p>混合舰队的成本模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>reserved</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>spot</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>elastic</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ondemand</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>overflow</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{total}} = C_{\\text{reserved}} \\times N_{\\text{base}} + C_{\\text{spot}} \\times N_{\\text{elastic}} + C_{\\text{ondemand}} \\times N_{\\text{overflow}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reserved</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">spot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">elastic</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ondemand</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overflow</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>典型配比：40% Reserved（覆盖日常低谷）+ 50% Spot（覆盖正常波动）+ 10% On-Demand（覆盖极端峰值）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分片策略\">分片策略</h2><p>当单个游戏世界无法由单台服务器承载时（如 MMO 主城），需要将世界分片：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 世界分片&#10;        S1[分片1: 区域A 玩家1-500]&#10;        S2[分片2: 区域A 玩家501-1000]&#10;        S3[分片3: 区域B 全部玩家]&#10;    end&#10;    GW[网关路由] --&gt;|&quot;玩家位置+负载&quot;| S1&#10;    GW --&gt; S2&#10;    GW --&gt; S3&#10;    S1 &lt;--&gt;|&quot;跨分片事件同步&quot;| S2\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 世界分片\n        S1[分片1: 区域A 玩家1-500]\n        S2[分片2: 区域A 玩家501-1000]\n        S3[分片3: 区域B 全部玩家]\n    end\n    GW[网关路由] --&gt;|\"玩家位置+负载\"| S1\n    GW --&gt; S2\n    GW --&gt; S3\n    S1 &lt;--&gt;|\"跨分片事件同步\"| S2</pre><p>分片边界是最复杂的工程问题。跨分片交互（如两个分片边界上的玩家互相攻击）需要额外的同步协议，通常通过&quot;边界重叠区&quot;解决——两个分片都模拟重叠区内的实体，由权威归属规则决定最终结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>扩缩容的目标是让基础设施的弹性匹配游戏流量的不可预测性。Fleet Manager 是核心编排器，混合扩容策略（预测 + 反应 + 缓冲）平衡了响应速度和成本，容器化 + 游戏感知 Controller（如 Agones）解决了 K8s 在有状态游戏场景下的不适配问题。分片是单世界无法由单机承载时的最后手段，其边界同步是最复杂的工程挑战。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"session-management\">会话管理</a>讲解实例分配后的玩家连接生命周期；<a href=\"persistence-database\">持久化与数据库</a>解决有状态数据在分布式环境中的一致性问题。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"服务器扩缩容模式","id":"服务器扩缩容模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"扩展方向：垂直 vs 水平","id":"扩展方向-垂直-vs-水平"},{"level":2,"text":"Fleet Management 架构","id":"fleet-management-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"弹性伸缩策略","id":"弹性伸缩策略"},{"level":2,"text":"区域部署与延迟优化","id":"区域部署与延迟优化"},{"level":2,"text":"容器化与编排","id":"容器化与编排"},{"level":2,"text":"成本优化模式","id":"成本优化模式"},{"level":2,"text":"分片策略","id":"分片策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"服务器 Tick 循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/foundations/server-tick-loop"},"next":{"title":"会话管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/infrastructure/session-management"}}